question:
Which resource endpoint design is RESTful?
```javascript
// Option A
app.get('/getUser/:id', ...);
app.post('/createUser', ...);
app.delete('/deleteUser/:id', ...);

// Option B
app.get('/users/:id', ...);
app.post('/users', ...);
app.delete('/users/:id', ...);
```

How should you design an endpoint to fetch related resources?
```javascript
// Option A
app.get('/users/:id/posts', ...);

// Option B
app.get('/posts?userId=:id', ...);
```

When should pagination be implemented?
```javascript
app.get('/items', (req, res) => {
  // no pagination; returns all items
});
```

What is the correct error response format?
```javascript
app.get('/users/:id', (req, res) => {
  const user = findUser(req.params.id);
  if (!user) {
    res.status(404).json({error: 'User not found'});
  }
});
```

Should an API support PUT and PATCH differently?
```javascript
// PUT: replace entire resource
PUT /users/1 { name: 'Alice' }

// PATCH: partial update
PATCH /users/1 { name: 'Alice' }
```

How should versioning be handled in REST APIs?
```javascript
// Option A
app.get('/v1/users', ...);
app.get('/v2/users', ...);

// Option B
app.get('/users', {
  'Accept': 'application/vnd.api+json;version=2'
});
```

What should be returned on successful POST to create a resource?
```javascript
app.post('/users', (req, res) => {
  const user = createUser(req.body);
  res.status(201).json(user);
});
```

Should DELETE endpoints return a response body?
```javascript
app.delete('/users/:id', (req, res) => {
  deleteUser(req.params.id);
  res.status(204).send();
});
```

How should you handle rate limiting in a REST API?
```javascript
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  if (req.headers['x-rate-limit-remaining'] === '0') {
    res.status(429).json({error: 'Rate limited'});
  } else {
    next();
  }
});
```
